1. P1 FIX: Time Travel Toy Model → Real Framingham/ASCVD Beast

Roast: Claude called it "partial"—understatement; toy model's 2008 relic. Fixed with exact formula from Framingham study. Shocking: Multi-branch interventions (statin + diet? 20% drop) with roasts ("15% MI risk? Change or croak!").
